└── README.md
```




## 2. Create a `.env` file

```env
MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key
PORT=3000
```

## 3. Start the application

```bash
npm start
```

or

```bash
node server.js
```

The application will be available at:

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

---

# Database Schema

## User

| Field    | Type   | Description         |
| -------- | ------ | ------------------- |
| name     | String | User's full name    |
| email    | String | User email (unique) |
| password | String | Hashed password     |

## Portfolio

| Field         | Type     | Description          |
| ------------- | -------- | -------------------- |
| user          | ObjectId | References User      |
| asset         | String   | Investment name      |
| shares        | Number   | Number of shares     |
| price         | Number   | Current market price |
| purchasePrice | Number   | Purchase price       |

## Transaction

| Field       | Type     | Description             |
| ----------- | -------- | ----------------------- |
| user        | ObjectId | References User         |
| category    | String   | Transaction category    |
| description | String   | Transaction description |
| amount      | Number   | Transaction amount      |
| date        | Date     | Date of transaction     |

---

# API Endpoints

## Authentication

| Method | Endpoint      | Description              |
| ------ | ------------- | ------------------------ |
| POST   | `/api/signup` | Register a new user      |
| POST   | `/api/login`  | Log in and receive a JWT |

## Portfolio

| Method | Endpoint             | Description          |
| ------ | -------------------- | -------------------- |
| GET    | `/api/portfolio`     | Retrieve portfolio   |
| POST   | `/api/portfolio`     | Add an investment    |
| DELETE | `/api/portfolio/:id` | Delete an investment |

## Transactions

| Method | Endpoint                | Description           |
| ------ | ----------------------- | --------------------- |
| GET    | `/api/transactions`     | Retrieve transactions |
| POST   | `/api/transactions`     | Add a transaction     |
| DELETE | `/api/transactions/:id` | Delete a transaction  |

## AI Assistant

| Method | Endpoint  | Description                                      |
| ------ | --------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| POST   | `/api/ai` | Generate AI financial advice using Google Gemini |

---

# Security

* Passwords are securely hashed using bcrypt before being stored.
* User authentication is handled using JSON Web Tokens (JWT).
* Protected routes require a valid authentication token.
* User data is stored securely in MongoDB.

